 r←NoOfUntrackedFiles y;rc;more;path;buff
⍝ Returns the number of unstaged and untracked changes (new+modified+deleted)
 path←2⊃EstablishProject y
 'Not a Cider/acre project'⎕SIGNAL 6/⍨0=≢path
 (rc more buff)←path U.RunGitCommand'status --porcelain'
 more U.Assert 0=rc
 :If 0=≢buff
     r←0
 :Else
     r←' '+.≠{⍵[;2]}↑buff
 :EndIf
⍝Done
